    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Sult\n1177PoT AL\nТам ранк\nCal\nTreasure Island on San Francisco Bay\nзлон\nL N\nVIC\nDear Friend - The people of the Western States have asked me to extend you an invitation to visit their World's\nFair on San Francisco Bay in 1939. Next year this Empire of the West will add to the attractions that draw thousands of\ntravelers each year, a Fair that will express the charm and glamour not only of this region but of the nations of the Pacific.\nThe Orient, South Seas, Antipodes, and the Latin Americas are joining us in a vast Pageant of the Pacific to be shown on\n400-acre Treasure Island in San Francisco Bay. These countries are building with us a Fair that will dramatize the sceneru,\nculture, and recreation of the world's most glamorous nations. In 1939 the Golden Gate International Exposition will be\nready, so that you, traveling through the Western Wonderland, may make your destination the Treasure Island that will hold\nfor you the romantic story of the western world.\nLeland W. Cutler\nDRESIDENT, 1939 Golden Gate International Expostlor\n2012.149.1713",
